{"sym":"IONQ","name":"IonQ, Inc.","crypto":false,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","country":"United States","employees":1132,"website":"https://www.ionq.com","exchange":"NYSE","summary":"IonQ, Inc. develops quantum computing systems in the United States, Switzerland, and Internationally. It sells access to quantum computers of various qubit capacities. The company also makes access to its quantum computers through cloud platforms, such as Amazon Web Services (AWS), Braket, Microsoft's Azure Quantum, and Google's Cloud Marketplace, as well as through its cloud service. The company engages in quantum-safe communications and quantum detection systems. It provides contracts associated with the design, development, construction, and sale of specialized quantum computing hardware systems; maintenance and support services; and consulting services related to co-developing algorithms on quantum computing systems. In addition, it provides semiconductor manufacturing services. The company has a collaboration agreement with University of Chicago. The company was founded in 2015 and is headquartered in College Park, Maryland.","ko":{"overview":"아이온큐는 이온 트랩 방식의 양자컴퓨터를 개발하는 회사입니다. AWS, 애저, 구글 클라우드를 통해 양자컴퓨터 사용권을 판매하고, 양자 보안 통신과 양자 센싱 사업도 하고 있습니다.","segments":["양자컴퓨팅 (클라우드 접근, 시스템 판매)","양자 네트워킹·보안 통신","양자 센싱"]},"price":30.04,"prev":31.72,"mc":12899406848,"next":{"date":"2026-11-05","timing":"amc","ts":"2026-11-05T20:00Z","estimated":false,"eps_avg":-0.3373,"eps_lo":-0.45,"eps_hi":-0.25,"rev_avg":141197670,"rev_lo":130000000,"rev_hi":155000000},"fin":{"rev":246474000,"rev_g":2.868,"eps_g":null,"gm":0.3085,"om":-4.0817,"pm":0.0,"roe":-0.6048,"fcf":-87774752},"val":{"pe":null,"fpe":-22.35,"peg":null,"ps":52.34,"pb":3.44,"ev_ebitda":-12.65,"eps":-3.43,"div":0.0},"health":{"cash":2118968960,"debt":54498000,"de":1.6,"cr":10.66,"short":0.1177,"short_days":1.8,"inst":0.4695,"insider":0.0066,"beta":3.36,"avg_vol":21987668},"analyst":{"mean":64.06,"lo":41.85,"hi":100.0,"n